(4. THE INGESTION PIPELINE) Tj
/F2 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 670.0 Tm
(4.1 TEXT EXTRACTION) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 655.0 Tm
(A PDF is read page by page. Page numbers are preserved at extraction time,) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 640.0 Tm
(because a citation that cannot name a page is not verifiable. Pages that) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 625.0 Tm
(yield no text are skipped; a document that yields no text at all is) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 610.0 Tm
(rejected as scanned or empty rather than indexed as a silent failure.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 576.0 Tm
(4.2 CHUNKING) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 561.0 Tm
(Extracted text is split recursively on paragraph, sentence, and word) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 546.0 Tm
(boundaries. The default chunk size is 1000 characters with an overlap of) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 531.0 Tm
(150 characters, an overlap of fifteen percent.) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 501.0 Tm
(Chunk size is a trade-off. Chunks that are too small lose the surrounding) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 486.0 Tm
(argument and retrieve confidently but answer incompletely. Chunks that are) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 471.0 Tm
(too large dilute the embedding, because a single vector must represent) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 456.0 Tm
(several unrelated ideas at once. Overlap exists so that a sentence falling) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 441.0 Tm
(across a boundary still appears whole in one of the two neighbours.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 407.0 Tm
(4.3 EMBEDDING) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 392.0 Tm
(Each chunk is converted into a dense vector by an embedding model. Two) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 377.0 Tm
(passages with similar meaning receive vectors that sit close together, so) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 362.0 Tm
(meaning-based search becomes a nearest-neighbour lookup. Chunks are) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 347.0 Tm
(embedded in batches of up to 500 to reduce the number of API round trips.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 313.0 Tm
(4.4 INDEXING) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 298.0 Tm
(Vectors are stored in a FAISS index, one index per document, written to) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 283.0 Tm
(disk. Because each document is a separate index, a document can be deleted) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 268.0 Tm
(by removing its directory, with no global rebuild.) Tj
ET
endstream
